<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classUdpDelaySimRunner" kindref="compound">UdpDelaySimRunner</ref> class processes command line args and spins up a single instance of <ref refid="classUdpDelaySim" kindref="compound">UdpDelaySim</ref> within its own process with ctrl-c interrupt support. </para>
</sect1>
